       "id": "Paragraph-24",
       "html": "The row to watch on this night is <strong>8:00pm</strong>. Remarks at a holiday party start late, run long, and land on a crowd that has been drinking since doors opened. Put a hard finish on them in the document, give it to whoever is speaking in advance, and put the band back up on time regardless.",
       "cls": "prose"
      }
     },
